  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> are the number of moles of solute and solvent<br />Then <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>mM</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Here m = molality<br />M = molar mass of the solvent.<br /><math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>n</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>n</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>0.725</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>46</mn></mrow> <mrow> <mn>1000</mn></mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>&nbsp;i</mtext><mtext>.&nbsp;e</mtext><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>0.0334</mn></mrow> </math><br />Thus<br />Weight loss in solution bulb <math><mo>∝</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></math><br />Weight loss in solution bulb <math><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></math><br />Now<em>,</em> <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.0685</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0334</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.05</mn><mi></mi><mtext>g</mtext></math><br /><br />&nbsp;",
